WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
I don't believe they even 
came after us in a dream...

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.000
We don't know what they're going to do.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.000
We can't let our guards down.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.000
But having Honoka by my side was reassuring.

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:38.550
We'll always be together.

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:41.310
From now on, we'll join forces, and no matter

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:43.500
what happens, we'll overcome it.

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:50.560
Today is finally the championship game.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:53.710
We struggled to get this far.

00:00:53.710 --> 00:00:55.630
I'm going to concentrate on the game, and

00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:57.450
do my best.

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:58.840
Listen, everyone!

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:01.340
This is the championship 
game, and our opponent

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:05.230
is our perennial rival, 
Otakaku Girls' School.

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:08.150
If by some remote chance you should lose this

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:09.480
game, it would be a disgrace!

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:14.090
All it takes is fighting spirit. 
Fighting spirit will win this game!

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:17.490
It's not just fighting spirit, but teamwork.

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:20.010
It's important for all of you to work 
together, and do your very best!

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:22.960
Just what I'd expect from you, Principal!
You're absolutely right!

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:26.190
It's nothing new, but his speech always 
brings our spirits down, doesn't it?

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:27.720
I agree.

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:33.290
Popo!

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:35.110
Good luck! Do your best popo!

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:37.690
What was that?
Did you hear something?

00:01:37.690 --> 00:01:40.030
Nagisa... Did you bring a stuffed animal?

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:41.080
I forgot!

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:45.820
You shouldn't have come here, Pollun!

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:48.190
Popo! It seems like such fun popo!

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:50.520
Honoka...!

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:52.320
Nagisa!

00:01:57.720 --> 00:01:59.830
Good luck! Do your best popo!

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:03.610
Honoka brought a cute mascot!

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:10.000
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:10.010 --> 00:02:12.670
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:15.450
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:19.920
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.620
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:25.760
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:27.360
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:31.360
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.160
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:38.970
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot,</i>

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:40.940
<i>we both</i>

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:42.270
<i>become stronger</i>

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:44.840
<i>and closer</i>

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:48.850
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:51.420
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:54.590
<i>Don't you know that good fortune</i>

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:57.160
<i>comes to the gates of laughter?
Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:57.460 --> 00:03:03.330
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:04.630
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:07.100
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:10.140
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:14.410
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are</i>

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:17.480
<i>Pretty Cure!</i>

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:21.220
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:28.230
The Power of Creation...

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:34.180
The extent of that power 
is immeasurable even to us.

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:41.800
It's as powerful as the 
Power of Annihilation.

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:46.430
The power of darkness will 
annihilate everything...

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:50.120
Nothing can be created from 
the darkness that's left.

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:54.810
The power of the stones, 
the Power of Creation

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:59.980
has the power and energy that's 
equal to the Power of Annihilation.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:06.860
There is no way that they would ignore 
something as powerful as the power of the stones.

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:13.190
The container must be somewhere.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:15.530
I know that.

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:21.370
The only thing that will make me 
complete is the Power of Creation.

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:24.680
As long as I cannot attain 
eternal life, none of you

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:29.200
will find peace.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:32.980
Jyaku-King, sir... Please 
wait for a while longer.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:41.860
"WE WON'T LOSE!! BLOW THE 
POWER OF DARKNESS AWAY!"

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:40.730
"WE WON'T LOSE!! BLOW THE POWER OF DARKNESS AWAY!"

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:53.300
We can't let Jyaku-King 
wait any longer, can we?

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:57.340
Before that, there's something 
we have to think about.

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:58.740
Think about?

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:02.300
What else is there to think about?

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:04.790
Since when have you turned 
into such a coward, Belzay?

00:05:05.350 --> 00:05:11.090
Haven't you realized the danger 
that is closing in on us?

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:12.390
Danger?

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:15.660
That's right. The danger that's 
right in front of our eyes.

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:17.470
What danger is he talking about?

00:05:17.470 --> 00:05:18.680
Danger. Danger.

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:20.410
Be quiet.

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:22.380
Be quiet.

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:23.540
What danger?

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:28.410
Danger. Danger. Danger. Danger. Danger.

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:30.980
Shut up before I pluck all your feathers off!

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:34.110
She's scary.

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:35.410
Scary!

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:40.410
We're the reincarnation of Jyaku-King.

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:42.150
There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:45.260
If you think danger is closing in on us, then

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:47.630
I want to see it with my own eyes.

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:50.500
Once everything is annihilated,

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:55.070
nothing can be created from the 
deep darkness that is left behind.

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:58.970
It's not just Jyaku-King that the power of

00:05:58.970 --> 00:06:01.480
darkness is gnawing at...

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:09.210
Relax!

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:12.380
Rather than winning, be sure you play 
the game so you don't have any regrets.

00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:14.850
Rina!

00:06:19.260 --> 00:06:20.590
I'm sorry, Nagisa!

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:22.060
No problem... no problem.

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:26.500
I'm sorry... Can you...?

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:36.540
Nagisa...!

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:38.710
Wasn't that ball return awesome?

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:42.120
We managed to win against 
them in the preliminaries,

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:45.680
but it seems like they've gotten 
even stronger than they were before.

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:48.650
They won the semifinals 
against Kakutokandaifuzoku

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:51.320
by a score of 7 to 1, didn't they?

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:53.860
That means they've definitely 
gotten a lot stronger.

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:56.860
We couldn't ask for a better opponent.

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:59.180
Just come at us!

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:03.610
Don't you think Nagisa's 
being a bit thick-skinned?

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:04.840
I agree... I certainly do.

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:10.330
Nagisa!

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:11.840
Do your best!

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:16.650
Rah! Rah! Na-gi-sa!

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:20.300
Rah! Rah! Nagisa!

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:21.850
Do your best, Nagisa!

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:23.490
Do your best, Nagisa!

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:26.170
Do your best, Sis!

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:28.750
Choose your shots! And it'll be a shoe-in!

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:31.500
You're so funny, dear.

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:33.000
You think so?

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:36.230
It's really embarrassing!

00:07:39.110 --> 00:07:43.380
For Yumiko and the other seniors, 
this will be their last game.

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:47.820
We have to win this game, and make 
this a brilliant end to their career.

00:07:52.010 --> 00:07:56.120
After the hard struggle, it would be 
meaningless if we don't win this. Isn't that right?

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:57.620
Shiho!

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:02.400
I finally... finally made it this far!

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:07.430
I've been thinking about 
it for a long, long time...

00:08:08.470 --> 00:08:09.840
I'm going to quit lacrosse.

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:11.910
You're kidding, aren't you?

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:16.380
I've overcome a lot of obstacles, haven't I?

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:17.280
Nagisa!

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:27.560
You did it!

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:29.320
That was great, Sis.

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:32.600
Principal! They did it! 
They scored, Principal!

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:34.790
I know... I saw it.

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:37.060
You did it!

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:39.100
-That was awesome mepo!

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:39.100
-That was awesome mipo!

00:08:39.770 --> 00:08:42.170
Let's keep it up!

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:43.940
Okay! Let's go!

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:53.240
Over here! Over here!

00:08:58.640 --> 00:08:59.150
What is this?

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:02.300
How can you get so caught 
up in a game like this?

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:04.200
I don't understand it.

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:05.120
That voice...

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:08.560
What happened?

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.750
I feel an awful presence mipo.

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:12.090
She's right mepo!

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:18.840
Wait a minute! Of all times for you to come...
You must be kidding!

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:26.440
What's going on?

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:29.050
I'm sure this is their doing mepo!

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:35.490
Nagisa disappeared!

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:38.440
Rah! Rah! Na-gi-sa!

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:40.830
You're doing great, Sis.

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:43.270
Why...?

00:09:43.990 --> 00:09:45.800
Why don't they even realize she's gone?

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:48.170
What am I going to do?

00:10:04.230 --> 00:10:05.480
What am I going to do?

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:07.460
Nagisa's...

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:10.220
You're coming, too!!

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:29.140
Where am I?

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:36.120
Honoka!

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:36.990
Nagisa!

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:37.850
Popo!

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:39.980
What's happening?

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.610
What's going on anyway? How can 
the game be going on without me?

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:53.470
It's really strange... No one seems 
to realize that you're not there.

00:10:53.470 --> 00:10:57.380
I made it so you can fight me without 
worrying about anything else.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:00.170
I've had enough of this!

00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:03.440
We've fought our way through the tournament, 
and finally made it to the championship game today.

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:07.350
Do you know how hard I practiced 
for this game today?

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:11.100
I practiced so hard that I dozed 
off in class so many times!

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:13.320
That doesn't have anything to do with this.

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:18.790
Anyway, I don't have time to 
be playing games with you!

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:23.230
Don't just stand there, and say something!

00:11:38.310 --> 00:11:39.610
Belzay...

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:43.740
Why are you hesitating?

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:45.420
Are you afraid?

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:54.540
Is the danger closing in on these two?

00:11:55.290 --> 00:11:57.130
What is he saying?

00:11:57.740 --> 00:12:01.000
I came here to see for myself.

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:07.130
What awesome energy mepo!

00:12:07.130 --> 00:12:08.540
Hurry, and transform mepo!

00:12:08.840 --> 00:12:09.980
Honoka!

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:23.990
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:10.840
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:13.570
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:17.440
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:20.850
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:24.280
Go back to where you came from!

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:38.730
Shiho!

00:13:43.240 --> 00:13:44.300
Nagisa!

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:48.470
It's okay, Nagisa!

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:03.450
Don't worry, Nagisa. The game's not over yet.

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:20.660
Belzay! What is it you're afraid of anyway?

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:24.940
What are you talking about?

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:26.740
But that energy isn't normal.

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.210
Popo!

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:31.680
I'm going to settle it all today.

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:34.550
Pretty Cure!

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:51.140
What... in the world...?

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:52.500
What's happening?

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:54.110
What's wrong?

00:14:58.740 --> 00:15:00.350
What in the world is happening?

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:01.640
I don't know, but...

00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:07.490
Is it you?

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:10.310
Are you responsible for this?

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:20.010
What is this?

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:32.440
Pretty Cula!

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:43.350
Accept the power of light popo!

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:04.940
Power of hope... Take the will of light...

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:08.450
And fight your way toward the future!

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:12.880
Pretty Cure Rainbow Storm!

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:34.970
What is that?

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:37.940
It's pushing the Rainbow Storm mepo!

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:42.380
Popo...

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:57.290
The Rainbow Storm is...

00:16:57.670 --> 00:16:58.760
...being pushed back!

00:17:31.770 --> 00:17:34.510
It's the power of the stones...

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:35.470
The power of the stones.

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:38.310
The power of the stones.

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:55.950
I won't forget this, Pretty Cure.

00:18:02.570 --> 00:18:03.750
Don't tell me...

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:06.000
Is that...?

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:12.970
What was that just now?

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:14.310
I don't know...

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:16.340
Pollun!

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:19.010
Popo...

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:21.950
Are you okay, Pollun?

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:23.920
I'm okay popo.

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:25.230
Thank you, Pollun.

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:26.350
What for popo?

00:18:28.630 --> 00:18:31.080
The championship game!

00:18:31.930 --> 00:18:33.190
Oh, no! I forgot!

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:40.600
It's over.

00:18:44.460 --> 00:18:46.090
What are you doing Nagisa?

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:48.510
Let's do our best in the overtime game.

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:50.270
Overtime game?

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:54.000
What do you think would 
have happened if Yumiko

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:55.760
hadn't made that return?

00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:59.360
Your play suddenly got sloppy 
midway through the game, Nagisa.

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:02.690
All right, everyone!

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:05.530
Let's give it all we've got in 
the six-minute overtime game.

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:12.140
They held Otakaku to a tied game 
with one-man short on the team.

00:19:13.260 --> 00:19:15.530
I'll have to do my best.

00:19:23.130 --> 00:19:24.010
Rina!

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.110
Shiho!

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:33.880
Darn!

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:37.620
Defense!

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:47.700
Nagisa!

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:01.110
We did it!

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:13.460
You did it!

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:20.000
You did it, Nagisa!

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:30.440
Popo... popo... popo... popo... popo...

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:36.900
Belzay!

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:41.820
What in the world happened to my body...?

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:46.790
Is this the danger you were talking about?

00:20:47.130 --> 00:20:49.760
You know what that black thing that came out

00:20:50.070 --> 00:20:54.230
from Juna's body was, don't you, Belzay?

00:20:57.160 --> 00:21:00.540
It's the same thing that's 
torturing Jyaku-King.

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:02.210
It's just a part of it.

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:09.460
Then the Power of Annihilation 
took over my body...?

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:15.370
The Power of Annihilation 
inside your body was

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:19.210
touched off by Pretty Cure's 
power, and flew out, Juna!

00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:22.860
The power of the stones! 
The power of the stones!

00:21:23.930 --> 00:21:25.930
Stop it! Be quiet!

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:27.200
The power of the stones?

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:29.670
No...

00:21:30.070 --> 00:21:31.530
It can't be!

00:21:31.530 --> 00:21:35.470
Then the light that turned back the power 
that came out of Juna's body was...?

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:38.040
So that was it, after all.

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:42.680
So that light was the power of the stones...

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:46.520
It's only a part of the Power of Creation.

00:21:48.090 --> 00:21:51.370
Who would have thought that 
something as powerful as

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:54.890
the Power of Creation was locked 
inside that little creature...

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:01.770
Then the Power of Creation, the power 
of the seven Prism Stones is in that...?

00:22:06.730 --> 00:22:08.940
We've solved the puzzle.

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:25.260
<i>Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.090 --> 00:22:26.790
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:26.790 --> 00:22:29.490
<i>L-O-V-E Love Love, get you!</i>

00:22:29.590 --> 00:22:32.230
<i>I can't do this!</i>

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:35.500
<i>I'd rather be a young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:37.940
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

